  "historyNote": "#6583, eff 9-20-97; amd by #6843 eff 8-29-98; ss by #7289, eff 6-1-00; ss by #7699, eff 6-5-02; amd by #7922, eff 7-24-03; ss by #8085, eff 5-26-04; amd by #8357, eff 5-25-05; amd by #8931, eff 7-6-07; ss by #9458, eff 4-21-09; ss by #10142, eff 6-5-12; ss by #10619, eff 6-2-14; amd by #10981, eff 1-1-16; ss by #13644, eff 6-1-23",
